                                "sense_id": "9f3b355d-affc-3b6b-bf1e-0e31de008914",
                                "text": "[…] on Sunday four more violinists, a second violist and a harpsichordist were added to give the ripieno sections of the fast movements a heftier punch than the smaller group delivered."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2fb3cbdf-9e4b-41ee-acbc-b94d70d1e78e",
                                "sense_id": "9f3b355d-affc-3b6b-bf1e-0e31de008914",
                                "text": "Some harpsichordists might have dismissed these works as not “authentic” Handel, Mr. Cooper said, though he surmised that the arrangements could have been prepared by Handel’s students."
                            }
                        ]
